{"id": "02a", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[storyteller] This is you. Twelve years old. Pretty smart. Pretty funny. [pause] And VERY scared of messing up."}, {"speaker": "TEACHER", "text": "[bored] Anyone? Seven times eight?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispering to himself] Fifty-six. [pause] It's fifty-six. [pause] ...But what if it's not?"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You always know the answer. You just never say it. [pause] Because what if you're wrong?"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] It was fifty-six."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "But in games? In games, you're fearless. [pause] Because in a game, when you fall... you just respawn."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] Real life does not have that feature. [pause] You checked."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "At home, there's Dad. He makes pancakes every morning... and the same joke every morning."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[proud] Why did the pancake go to the doctor? [pause] Because it was feeling a little... FLAT!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "There's your little sister, Bea. She's six... and she has never told a lie in her life."}, {"speaker": "BEA", "text": "[tiny voice, honest] Your hair looks like a mushroom. [pause] A sad mushroom."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 7.44, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 111, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb", "start_time_seconds": 7.44, "end_time_seconds": 10.16, "character_start_index": 111, "character_end_index": 145, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 10.16, "end_time_seconds": 15.52, "character_start_index": 145, "character_end_index": 236, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 15.52, "end_time_seconds": 20.8, "character_start_index": 236, "character_end_index":